    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing. there is no \"next note.\" i realize now that i've already used up everything i had. i can feel the ceiling above me. if i keep going, i'm just going to produce garbage and watch the person i used to be die a slow, embarrassing death. wouldn't it be better to just stop now, while the memory of my work is still good? i'd rather stop now while i'm still 'something' than live to see myself become a joke.",
